<description>&lt;p&gt;A blaze on Phuket island killed at least 11 people and prompted emergency response, while arsenic contamination in the Salween River at the Myanmar border forced Thai authorities to provide clean water for thousands. Iranian and Hezbollah operatives recruited six Thai clerics for a planned attack on the Israeli embassy in Bangkok that was foiled, and Thai police arrested four suspects in a cross-border human-smuggling ring. President Trump signed a trade deal with Thailand despite earlier reports it was unresolved, and Prime Minister Hun Sen urged Thailand to begin border demarcation and took the dispute to international forums. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/17/world/trump-asean-summit/trumps-trade-deal-with-thailand-is-not-a-done-deal&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxPS1BjUDI5Ykk1ZmxUaGlITUVidXpZU2RPS25iVWhmT2tldHI3UExaRXhxZHl2eE41VnVFRlpUbXpJMDZVTWRQVXROVEEwaklNSGt6QUlJSGw3NFpYTFd6ZTNiSjJVakc4MmpzbjZPUE1Tb1FnNE4zNGpRMnZfRWE4TU16Ukgzc1oyT0dKeTA3YUNRT3B6N1JJd0ZhdnE1R2dKNV9KWVV1SUQzNF9SX1ZUVUZmNDdDdDRZbWRub2I4N2tmbG9wVng3WFdKaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNR1pNMjFsWWdBSllQdmV1b2gxZ25fUlk3VG0yU0gxemU2Zm4xcGJsWlVPLXc3dlpjWE1FWDlSUnFKSTcwM3htbU1laDNhNFNvVVVMcGhmZ1U2cXdGRl9YZzNtU3RNLUVEUmZrY1R1N2NwblMxcE45dXQ4NEZ2a1ZETUFSdEpYZU9DMEdKRUxkSDZKUXpwN2ltQg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNbUpKWXZoNFFKRXdCOXVrZ2hlNXJub2VyMTVQSFl2eUZxYVVlN2E1VDI3STV4YXhkLWs0STFPMGhkS01oLVRJRHd0dm0zTmdPSEVqRjF1aTdYNGU0Q0xaUjFwY0tDYy0tVk9iODQ3NUJ0VU95MzZLMDdCamoyWjlqWTh6RFZtcEVvREd6TjJ6dEliOXFqbkFCSXhn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khme